description: Área Derechos (roles y funciones) — leer su INDEX antes de tocar este código
globs:
  - "Desing/Helpers/Function*.cs"
  - "Desing/Helpers/SecurityRepository.cs"
  - "Desing/Controllers/RoleController.cs"
  - "Desing/Controllers/FunctionController.cs"
  - "Desing/Views/Role/**"
  - "Desing/Views/Function/**"
  - "Desing/Views/Employee/AssignRoles.cshtml"
  - "Desing/Views/Shared/_TandemFunctions.cshtml"
  - "Desing/Views/Shared/AccessDenied.cshtml"
